IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-MOBA-ROUTING.

DATA DIVISION.
01 NUM-BLOCKS          PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 TOP-K               PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 ROUTED-BLOCKS       PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 MEM-SAVED-PCT       PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-MOBA.
    IF NUM-BLOCKS == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    IF TOP-K > NUM-BLOCKS
        MOVE NUM-BLOCKS TO ROUTED-BLOCKS.
    ELSE
        IF TOP-K <= 0
            MOVE 1 TO ROUTED-BLOCKS.
        ELSE
            MOVE TOP-K TO ROUTED-BLOCKS.
        END-IF.
    END-IF.

    COMPUTE MEM-SAVED-PCT = ((NUM-BLOCKS - ROUTED-BLOCKS) * 100) / NUM-BLOCKS.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 MEM-SAVED-PCT.
    WEIGHT 30 ROUTED-BLOCKS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 10.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
